        "title": "Holy Abode of the Lord",
        "text": "Pashupatinath Temple in Kathmandu Nepal is a huge monument which is an excellent visit by all nationals ... Hindus are only allowed To enter the sanctum sanatorium.. Clicking of pics is strictly not allowed.. River Bhagmati flows adjacent and all the final rites are done at the ghats .. It’s a wonderful temple with positive vibes and rich history.. It’s a fifteen min journey from the airport and do avoid Monday, Tuesday and Saturday as it’s crowded. Any given day during Aarti time is crowded and will take anywhere between an hour or more.. Lot of improvement work is currently taking place around the monument ... Holy place which has an history and it’s an abode to the lord Shiva ... Aum Namah Shivaya... 🙏",
