        "text": "This had been removed from our itinerary as the company we travelled with had feedback from other travellers saying they didn’t enjoy it.  I don’t think it’s about enjoyment rather than an interesting insight into the rituals of a different culture. As we were not Hindu, we couldn’t go into the temples but you can walk around & just be there. After paying our entrance fee a local guide started to explain about the place, we agreed a price with him after some bartering & he showed us around, explaining the rituals, beliefs & roles of the Sadhu’s.  ",
